Sat Aug 22 05:38:49 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Initial package of modelscope-hub 0.2.0: official Python SDK and
  CLI for ModelScope Hub (download, upload and manage models,
  datasets, Studio spaces, skills and MCP servers)
  * Ships modelscope-hub and ms-hub console scripts
  * Runtime dependencies: requests >= 2.28, tqdm >= 4.64.0,
    filelock >= 3.9, urllib3 >= 1.26

